{"w":2400,"h":3209,"lines":[{"h":0.021175413042585411,"y":0.03455523837888308,"c":1,"t":"Reading","w":0.08694721221923829,"x":0.81869530166609272},{"c":1,"t":"Questions 17-22","w":0.17475728352864583,"h":0.014534883112922281,"y":0.088662790993419893,"x":0.069902911536647988},{"x":0.06601940637104424,"c":1,"w":0.7533980814615886,"h":0.019003115264797477,"y":0.12056074738090106,"t":"Look at the following statements (Questions 17-22) and the list of people below."},{"h":0.019003115264797477,"y":0.15545171328189999,"t":"Match each statement with the correct person or people, A-E.","w":0.58640777587890636,"c":1,"x":0.066019412934333277},{"w":0.64286651611328138,"y":0.18602408128193937,"c":1,"x":0.058170366969743696,"h":0.021362651694229462,"t":"Write the correct letter, A-E, in boxes 17-22 on your answer sheet."},{"c":1,"y":0.2208722739981418,"w":0.42524271647135409,"t":"NB You may use any letter more than once.","x":0.066019418296361751,"h":0.017499819128684146},{"t":"17 The methodology behind the growth mindset studies was not strict enough.","y":0.25576323988693672,"x":0.06601941367429276,"h":0.017492574174827524,"w":0.75533981323242183,"c":1},{"y":0.28037383186978682,"w":0.65242716471354156,"h":0.017591284517187056,"c":1,"x":0.066019427253702787,"t":"18 The idea of the growth mindset has been incorrectly interpreted."},{"t":"19","h":0.013081395514657479,"c":1,"x":0.066019416730512592,"w":0.027184467315673838,"y":0.30668604637421193},{"h":0.020009144815700486,"c":1,"t":"Intellectual ability is an unchangeable feature of each individual.","x":0.097027563730148786,"y":0.30324779737168805,"w":0.61952880859374992},{"c":1,"h":0.017477178722155817,"x":0.066019429476024627,"y":0.32990654231635841,"t":"20 The growth mindset should be promoted without students being aware of it.","w":0.75922327677408852},{"y":0.35297902165631112,"t":"21 The growth mindset is not simply about boosting students' morale.","h":0.021461869474512008,"c":1,"x":0.065960803870301093,"w":0.67195190429687501},{"w":0.82135920206705726,"c":1,"x":0.066019427985888793,"y":0.37632398778492149,"h":0.020560747663551426,"t":"22 Research shows that the growth mindset has no effect on academic achievement."},{"w":0.14239135742187503,"c":1,"y":0.4251980106749027,"h":0.018542285574559392,"t":"List of People","x":0.41324303940675688},{"y":0.4520249223358912,"x":0.28543689544889539,"t":"A Alfred Binet","c":1,"w":0.16310679117838545,"h":0.019003115264797588},{"w":0.17669902801513676,"c":1,"t":"B Carol Dweck","y":0.48255451723436271,"h":0.017445482866043638,"x":0.28543689366120567},{"w":0.20194174448649088,"x":0.28543689469755029,"t":"C Andrew Gelman","c":1,"h":0.0188953482844747,"y":0.51017441886249371},{"t":"D Timothy Bates","h":0.020348838259497848,"c":1,"y":0.53924418550708375,"w":0.18446601867675783,"x":0.28543689344980655},{"y":0.56632476823724953,"t":"David Yeager and Gregory Walton","c":1,"x":0.31827842286735425,"w":0.34013267517089846,"h":0.02374337217146727},{"w":0.18058252970377603,"y":0.61619937672926761,"x":0.067961162236569381,"h":0.019003115264797588,"t":"Questions 23-26","c":1},{"h":0.020560747663551426,"w":0.80388351440429684,"c":1,"y":0.65109034300829283,"t":"Do the following statements agree with the views of the writer in Reading Passage 2?","x":0.067961155322359634},{"t":"In boxes 23-26 on your answer sheet, write","w":0.413876215616862,"h":0.019588686744000716,"y":0.6852097862772154,"c":1,"x":0.065867677773380151},{"h":0.014534883112922281,"y":0.72383720956999231,"c":1,"x":0.13980582566545191,"w":0.044660193125406894,"t":"YES"},{"t":"NO","w":0.033009707132975269,"h":0.01308139551465759,"x":0.13980582594807547,"c":1,"y":0.74273255801302007},{"t":"if the statement agrees with the views of the writer","w":0.47786605834960938,"h":0.019041202818493197,"x":0.27368853256925829,"y":0.72160690220793899,"c":1},{"w":0.47010635375976556,"t":"if the statement contradicts the views of the writer","y":0.7405015566287777,"x":0.27368723753085117,"h":0.018145135184314709,"c":1},{"t":"NOT GIVEN if it is impossible to say what the writer thinks about this","w":0.65825241088867181,"h":0.017491668629869173,"x":0.13980583329265092,"y":0.76012461054781844,"c":1},{"t":"23 Dweck has handled criticisms of her work in an admirable way.","x":0.065945171001346906,"h":0.019302201196783386,"y":0.79325590817838265,"w":0.63900243123372402,"c":1},{"h":0.020562470813406564,"c":1,"x":0.065969450683172393,"w":0.80203755696614576,"t":"24 Students' self-perception is a more effective driver of self-confidence than actual","y":0.81800620872598029},{"y":0.8387247427976825,"x":0.1124592524991589,"t":"achievement is.","w":0.15191234588623048,"h":0.017480825263763045,"c":1},{"x":0.065976933508003127,"h":0.019505178742690976,"w":0.73213099161783857,"c":1,"t":"25 Recent evidence about growth mindset interventions has attracted unfair","y":0.86333648128133},{"c":1,"x":0.11244555633569599,"t":"coverage in the media.","y":0.88488144002365166,"w":0.21972513834635421,"h":0.018499664948365413},{"t":"Deliberate attempts to encourage students to strive for high achievement may have","x":0.097087391808757958,"y":0.90841121519125378,"w":0.80194173177083339,"h":0.017460877130336061,"c":1},{"w":0.16699029286702477,"t":"a negative effect.","x":0.11262135838444881,"y":0.92866043632769257,"h":0.016199376947040434,"c":1},{"t":"p. 126","x":0.7786407782823429,"c":1,"w":0.066019414265950593,"h":0.016199376947040434,"y":0.95482866026735969},{"x":0.87766990299872061,"t":"91","y":0.95494186069644582,"w":0.025242718060811353,"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1}]}